{"id": "t112-014", "text": "for future reference - theo's into climbing, watches all those bouldering videos, and he collects old film cameras, has like 20 of them on a shelf. bday is in june i think, mid june? his girlfriend said he's been eyeing up a particular olympus but couldn't remember the model. could ask her nearer the time. also he doesn't drink so no wine", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "theo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "climbing", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "bouldering videos", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "old film cameras", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "has like 20 of them", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "bday", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in june", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "mid june", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "been eyeing up a particular olympus", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask her", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "nearer the time", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't drink", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t112-022", "text": "wiremu messaged from nz, he's back end of next wk. he went home for his nan's 90th, sounds like the whole extended family turned up, 3 days of food. his cousin is getting engaged too apparently. he said he's jetlagged already just thinking about the flight back lol. ask him how it all went once he's settled, maybe the weekend after", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "wiremu", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of next wk", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "went home", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "nan", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "90th", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "cousin", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting engaged", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "r2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask him how it all went", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "once he's settled", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend after", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t112-024", "text": "simone is the one at work whose husband runs the bakery on high st. she's from lyon originally", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "simone", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "at work", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "runs the bakery on high st", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "from lyon", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t112-027", "text": "leon said his band has a gig at the crown sometime in nov, he'll send dates. they've got a new drummer, Rafael from his work, and they've been rehearsing every tues. he's nervous cos it's the first one with all their own songs, no covers. zoe and a few others said they'd come. i should get tickets once he sends them and wish him luck on the night", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "leon", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "band", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gig at the crown", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in nov", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "drummer", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rafael", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "from his work", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "rehearsing", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every tues", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "zoe", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get tickets", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "once he sends them", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "wish him luck", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "on", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night", "anchor": "a2"}]}
