{"id": "t112-044", "text": "anjali's off to japan in the spring for 3 wks w/ her sister Simone, cherry blossom season. they're doing tokyo, kyoto then up to hokkaido. she's been saving for ages. her sister is a teacher so they had to fit it round the easter hols. said she'd bring me back some proper matcha. she's a bit anxious about flying that long but excited", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "anjali", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off to japan", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the spring", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "3 wks", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Simone", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "cherry blossom season", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "teacher", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "round the easter hols", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit anxious about flying that long", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "excited", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t112-048", "text": "amy's 40th is the 5th of nov. she wants nothing fussy, said she'd hate a surprise party. her husband was planning one so i'd better tell him quietly. she mentioned wanting a nice fountain pen, she's been journalling every morning since the summer. remind me to get the pen sometime the week b4 and book somewhere small for dinner, maybe the italian on church st", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "amy", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "40th", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 5th of nov", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants nothing fussy", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "hate a surprise party", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "tell him quietly", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wanting a nice fountain pen", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "journalling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every morning since the summer"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get the pen", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime the week b4", "anchor": "a2"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "book somewhere small for dinner", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
